      "paragraph_id": "p18",
      "relation": "states",
      "link_method": "llm_citation",
      "anchor_grade": "excerpt",
      "review_status": "pending",
      "source_excerpt": "Right now those balance of payments shortfalls can arise from a massive terms of trade shock (many oil exporters), from a fall off in financial inflows (South Africa), or even from a run on a dollarized domestic banking system (Lebanon)."
     }
    ]
